name=The Catalogue
id=TheCatalogue
author=trentini
description=Craft The Catalogue from a Notebook and use it to buy and sell items for cash. Every vanilla item is priced individually; items added by other mods are priced by the same rules and can be filtered by source mod. NOTE: with many item mods installed, the first time you open the Buy window in a session takes a few seconds while every modded item is priced. It is instant afterwards. Buying deducts real Money and MoneyBundles; selling pays 30 percent of value by default, scaled by condition, adjustable in the sandbox options, and never destroys what it will not pay for. SINGLE-PLAYER: every transaction is worked out on your own machine, so on a dedicated server the prices and the payments can be tampered with. Server authority is planned for after 1.0.
